Nebula Browser
=============

Fork of [alan-maldonado/appletv-nebula-browser](https://github.com/alan-maldonado/appletv-nebula-browser) focused on standards-based video playback: more reliable HTML5/HLS video in and out of full screen, WebVTT subtitles, and page interactions.

**Intended use:** a browser is neutral technology — this fork is meant for content you are legally entitled to view. It is not intended for, and its authors do not endorse, accessing copyrighted material without authorization. All trademarks and service names belong to their respective owners.

